  "reflectionText": "The father cried out with tears: I believe. Help my unbelief. Jesus rebuked the spirit, and the boy became like one dead. Jesus took him by the hand, and he arose. What does it take to bring both the belief and the unbelief in the same breath, and to be answered by the hand that lifts your son back into your arms?"
